Limit: the verifier read a receipt key no producer has ever written, so its validate step always ran with an empty generation and no pair could reach PASS
Ruled-out: reading the generation from the pair's own pair.json instead of the receipt | a pair that misnamed its own generation would then be the thing vouching for that name, which is the self-attestation the index digest is kept outside to avoid
Warn: a verifier whose every measured row passes can still be structurally unable to pass — read the verdict row that failed, not the rows that did not
